## What remains open from round 13

- Multi-channel CLI/MCP smoke test (round-12 #10) — not a critical path
  today; deferred until CLI/MCP gets real auth.
- Round-12 carryovers: hire-role allow-list, hire→onboarding
  transactionality, compliance cache invalidation, trust chain finalize,
  immutable audit log.
- T-R055 webhook two-way sync semantic gap (deep-analyst HIGH 4) —
  current path is one-way Arbor→Google, the inbound write-back never
  fires because Google push payloads are empty. Docs updated; full
  two-way sync is its own cluster.
- Architectural split of recruitment.py (3,382 lines) and onboarding.py
  (4,060 lines).

